    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover high-tech hazards, threatening robots, and unlikely friends as you jump through countless floors of a secret laboratory stretching deep underground</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock up to 8 characters each with special abilities that help you complete levels faster  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find bonus levels between main stages that focus on a single character's unique traits </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play all levels on an endless loop with increasing difficulty and try to beat your best score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the Swaplings learn to work together as they try to escape the lab and reach freedom</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover high-tech hazards, threatening robots, and unlikely friends as you jump through countless floors of a secret laboratory stretching deep underground</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock up to 8 characters each with special abilities that help you complete levels faster  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find bonus levels between main stages that focus on a single character's unique traits </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play all levels on an endless loop with increasing difficulty and try to beat your best score</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the Swaplings learn to work together as they try to escape the lab and reach freedom</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Swaplings is a tag-team platformer about eight genetic experiments working together to escape the depths of a secret underground laboratory. Use each character's special abilities to jump gaps, stomp robots, and smash platforms until you can reach the surface and find freedom.",
